  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  NegBinomPDF
  @  Density (or mass) at X.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 3; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 3 ≠ THEN "NegBinomPDF: needs 3 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → rsv pv Xv « rsv 0 + pv 0 + Xv 0 + → rs p X « 'IFTE(X<0;0;IFTE(X>rs*(1-p)/p+40*√(rs*(1-p))/p;0;COMB(IP(X)+rs-1;IP(X))*(p^rs)*((1-p)^IP(X))))' →Num rsv pv Xv 3 →List Drop » »
